flowchart TD
    classDef client fill:#1e3a8a,stroke:#60a5fa,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff;
    classDef server fill:#065f46,stroke:#34d399,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff;
    classDef db fill:#78350f,stroke:#fbbF24,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff;
    classDef process fill:#312e81,stroke:#818cf8,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff;

    Start([Blazor WASM Client App]) --> ActionChoice{Select Action / Event}

    %% 1. NFC Attendance Flow
    ActionChoice -->|1. Tap NFC Card / Scan UID| ScanReq[POST scan.php<br/>Payload: nfcTagId]:::client
    ScanReq --> PHPScan[PHP: scan.php]:::server
    PHPScan --> DBFindUser[(Query: users table<br/>Find by NfcTagId)]:::db
    DBFindUser --> CheckUser{User Found?}
    CheckUser -->|No| Err1[Return JSON: Error User Not Found]:::server
    CheckUser -->|Yes| DBGetSettings[(Query: campussettings<br/>By EducationalLevel)]:::db
    DBGetSettings --> DBGetLastLog[(Query: attendancelogs<br/>Get Last Log for Today)]:::db
    DBGetLastLog --> EvaluateAction{Determine Action Status}
    
    EvaluateAction -->|Last Log is EXIT or None| DoEntry[INSERT attendance log<br/>ActionStatus = ENTRY, Status = ON Campus]:::process
    EvaluateAction -->|Last Log is ENTRY| DoExit[UPDATE attendance log<br/>ActionStatus = EXIT, Status = OFF Campus, TimeOut = NOW]:::process
    
    DoEntry --> RetScan[Return JSON Success & User Info]:::server
    DoExit --> RetScan
    RetScan --> RenderScan[Render UI Feedback & Status]:::client

    %% 2. Registration Flow
    ActionChoice -->|2. Register New User| RegReq[POST register.php<br/>Payload: SchoolId, Names, NfcTagId, Role]:::client
    RegReq --> PHPReg[PHP: register.php]:::server
    PHPReg --> DBClean[(Query: Check duplicate SchoolId or NfcTagId)]:::db
    DBClean --> CheckDup{Is Duplicate?}
    CheckDup -->|Yes| RetDup[Return JSON Error: Already Exists]:::server
    CheckDup -->|No| DBInsertUser[(INSERT INTO users table)]:::db
    DBInsertUser --> RetReg[Return JSON Success]:::server
    RetReg --> RenderReg[Show Success/Error Notification]:::client

    %% 3. Live Logs Polling Flow
    ActionChoice -->|3. Live Dashboard Polling| PollLoop[PeriodicTimer: Every 2 Seconds]:::client
    PollLoop --> LogsReq[GET get_logs.php]:::client
    LogsReq --> PHPLogs[PHP: get_logs.php]:::server
    PHPLogs --> DBLogs[(SELECT logs LEFT JOIN users<br/>ORDER BY timestamp DESC LIMIT 50)]:::db
    DBLogs --> RetLogs[Return JSON Logs Array]:::server
    RetLogs --> RenderLogs[StateHasChanged & Refresh UI Grid]:::client

    %% 4. Management, Settings & Reports Flow
    ActionChoice -->|4. Admin Config, Reports & CRUD| AdminReq[HTTP GET/POST/DELETE<br/>manage_users.php, settings.php, get_reports.php]:::client
    AdminReq --> PHPAdmin[PHP Backend APIs]:::server
    PHPAdmin --> DBAdmin[(Execute SQL Queries:<br/>UPDATE / DELETE / SELECT with Filters)]:::db
    DBAdmin --> RetAdmin[Return Affected Rows or Filtered Dataset]:::server
    RetAdmin --> RenderAdmin[Update Views, Excel Export, or Print]:::client
